  2dc3cb522b5149d3 t("Pinned · drag to reorder (approved 26 Nov, no Move up / Move down)",Inter,22,sb,align(l),lh(auto,1.23)) p(32,32) s(fill,hug:27) ext(1736,) f[(ff9db5330e7daee5,#ECECEC)] "Text 675"
  021bbff874ca30ac t("Amendment (owner, 26 Nov): no Move up / Move down. Order by drag and drop, in the rail's Pinned zone and in the Pinned group at the top of every list; one reorder primitive in packages/ui. Mouse: press and drag the row itself, no grip on hover (OR-37, no exceptions); drag lifts a ghost of the row, the source stays dimmed in place, a drop line shows where it lands. Keyboard: Space grabs the focused pinned row, arrows move it, Space or Enter drops, Escape cancels; each step is announced (aria-live). Touch: long-press lifts the item, drag, release drops. The order is saved in person settings (rowPins).",Inter,16,r,align(l),lh(auto,1.19)) p(32,83) s(1500,hug:47.5) f[(1833b43bde13901e,tok(color.text.primary,#161617))] "Text 676"
